gger AI replies. Set it to your Meta app secret.\\\",\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!isEncryptionConfigured()) {\\n    warnings.push({\\n      code: \\\"ENCRYPTION_KEY_MISSING\\\",\\n      severity: \\\"warning\\\",\\n      title: \\\"Token encryption key is missing\\\",\\n      message:\\n        \\\"WHATSAPP_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY is not set, so access tokens can't be saved or decrypted. Set a random value of at least 32 characters.\\\",\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  return warnings;\\n}\\n\\n/** Midnight \\\"today\\\" in an IANA timezone, as a UTC instant. */'''),\\n])\\np='components/console/PulseOverview.tsx'\\ns=open(p).read()\\nold='''      <TokenBanner health={health} />\\n'''\\nassert s.count(old)==1\\ns=s.replace(old,'''      <ConfigWarnings health={health} canConfigure={canConfigure} />\\n\\n      <TokenBanner health={health} />\\n''')\\ns=s.replace('''import type {\\n  WhatsAppEventItem,''','''import type {\\n  HealthWarning,\\n  WhatsAppEventItem,''')\\ns+='''\\nfunction ConfigWarnings({\\n  health,\\n  canConfigure,\\n}: {\\n  health: WhatsAppHealth | null;\\n  canConfigure: boolean;\\n}) {\\n  if (!health || health.warnings.length === 0) return null;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n      {health.warnings.map((warning: HealthWarning) => (\\n        <div\\n          key={warning.code}\\n          role=\\\"alert\\\"\\n          className={cx(\\n            \\\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border px-4 py-3 text-sm motion-safe:animate-fade-up\\\",\\n            warning.severity === \\\"critical\\\"\\n              ? \\\"border-red-900/60 bg-red-950/40 text-red-200\\\"\\n              : \\\"border-amber-800/50 bg-amber-950/40 text-amber-200\\\"\\n          )}\\n        >\\n          <AlertTriangle className=\\\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0\\\" />\\n          <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n            <p className=\\\"font-medium\\\">{warning.title}</p>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-0.5 opacity-80\\\">{warning.message}</p>\\n            {!canConfigure && (\\n              <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-xs opacity-70\\\">Ask an owner or admin to fix this.</p>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      ))}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n'''\\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\\nEOF\"]" cwd=/home/sleeky3750/pulse-web http.span=4666752 role=server
